<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia peso ends 0.35 higher vs dlr at 1,063.30.</title>
<headline>Colombia peso ends 0.35 higher vs dlr at 1,063.30.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Colombian peso edged up 0.35 centavos to close at 1,063.30 in quiet trading on the country's interbank market, dealers said.</p>
<p>They reported 244 trades for a below-average total of just $94 million and said the peso hit an intraday low of 1,064.10 before trending higher ahead of the close.</p>
<p>(-- Juan Guillermo Londono, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944)</p>
